# Chapter 10: the Zealan shrine. Mythran's Zealan ceremonial shield on the
# altar of the Zealan gods (they speak), Mythran's scroll at the sealed
# doors, Khumash-Gor's tomb, Grant Peace on him, the obelisk tip from the
# small box behind the throne (the first piece of blackrock).
do: bypass:12128,2980,8,54 past the fence maze, the grave (Open Ground), the marble gate and the stair puzzle to the altar of the Zealan gods
# the shield on the altar (dragged there); the gods speak when he walks on
do: dropat:828/0:353,180;t60;walk:11950,2980;keys:6,30;until:free/8000
# the scroll at the sealed doors (the shield on the altar is near enough)
do: walk:11330,2880;operate:827/0;page;page;until:free/2000;t100
do: packin:395/10,637:0,1;packin:395/15,637:0,1;useon:232:0,637:0
do: reach:10400,2880
do: operate:17388;pickup:17389;t10;useon:746/7,62;t300
